# Stage 1: enemies appear on the right when the level reaches their progression
# (pixels of stage-1.png scrolled, 30 per second).
#
# The scrolling stops when the end of stage-1.png (4224 px wide) reaches the
# right edge of the screen (~427 px of background shown): 4224 - 427 = 3797.
# The boss comes then.
#
# y is the top of the enemy (0 at the top of the screen), or random: a height
# drawn when the enemy appears, different in every game.
#
# Types: pata-pata (shoots, drops a life one time in ten), pow-armor (never
# shoots, always drops a Force item: a Force, then levels 2 and 3).
#
# loot (optional) changes what the enemy drops when a player kills it: life or
# force (always), life:<chance> or force:<chance> (0 to 1), or none.
